^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-08-24 15:08] observe — main reports 57 warnings across 381 files; one belongs to an ignored session corpus memo, leaving 56 committed-source warnings.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:12] diagnose — warnings divide into dialect false positives, sigil binding lookahead, repeated unparsed forms, three machine-frame spellings, and derived-session scope.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:15] implement — header-scoped dialect detection and colon lookahead pass 57 focused seed tests and reduce committed warnings from 56 to 53.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:17] surprise — `key: |` appears 64 times across canon; warning traces identify a missing indentation-bounded block-scalar production rather than isolated typos.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:18] taste — block scalars should become a known prose leaf with an exact indentation boundary, not a permissive rest-of-file escape hatch.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:20] verify — header-scoped dialect and sigil-binding lookahead pass 709 seed tests and TypeScript build; committed-source warnings fall from 56 to 53.
}

